OL,3,GNEWSAA63 partially closed after lorry
OL,4,Ahits bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A63 in East Yorkshire has
OL,7,Fbeen closed after a lorry hit a bridge,
OL,8,FHumberside Police said.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to the Dale Road
OL,11,Fbridge in Elloughton at about 15:00 BST
OL,12,Fon Monday.
OL,14,FThe force said Dale Road is closed at
OL,15,Fthe junction with Welton Low Road, as
OL,16,Fwell as the Elloughton westbound slip
OL,17,Froad and the A63 eastbound at the South
OL,18,FCave junction "to allow emergency
OL,19,Fservices to work safely".
OL,21,FMotorist have been advised to avoid the
OL,22,Farea and find alternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
